</given-names></string-name>, <string-name><surname>Bobashev</surname><given-names>GV</given-names></string-name><article-title>Controlling pandemic flu: the value of international air travel restrictions.</article-title><source>PLoS ONE</source>. <year>2007</year>;<volume>2</volume>:<fpage>e401</fpage>PubMed <pub-id pub-id-type="doi">10.1371/journal.pone.0000401</pub-id><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">17476323</pub-id></mixed-citation></ref><ref id="R26"><label>26. </label><mixed-citation publication-type="journal"><string-name><surname>Hsu</surname><given-names>C-I</given-names></string-name>, <string-name><surname>Shih</surname><given-names>H-H</given-names></string-name><article-title>Transmission and control of an emerging influenza pandemic in a small-world airline network.</article-title><source>Accid Anal Prev</source>. <year>2010</year>;<volume>42</volume>:<fpage>93</fpage>&#x02013;<lpage>100</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="doi">10.1016/j.aap.2009.07.004</pub-id><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">19887149</pub-id></mixed-citation></ref><ref id="R27"><label>27. </label><mixed-citation publication-type="journal"><string-name><surname>Bell</surname><given-names>DM</given-names></string-name>; <collab>World Health Organization Working Group on Prevention of International and Community Transmission of SARS</collab><article-title>Public health interventions and SARS spread, 2003.</article-title><source>Emerg Infect Dis</source>. <year>2004</year>;<volume>10</volume>:<fpage>1900</fpage>&#x02013;<lpage>6</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">15550198</pub-id></mixed-citation></ref><ref id="R28"><label>28. </label><mixed-citation publication-type="journal"><string-name><surname>Reed</surname><given-names>C</given-names></string-name>, <string-name><surname>Angulo</surname><given-names>FJ</given-names></string-name>, <string-name><surname>Swerdlow</surname><given-names>DL</given-names></string-name>, <string-name><surname>Lipsitch</surname><given-names>M</given-names></string-name>, <str